{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17102360","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17102360","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710236001:1":{"text":"로완, 여긴 당신의 노점인가요? 미안해요, 일부러 과녁을 망가뜨리려던 건...","source_cn":"罗万，这是你的摊位？抱歉，我不是要故意破坏箭靶——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE14531A00E7CA00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710236002:1":{"text":"망가뜨리다니요? 아뇨! 귀네스 씨. 방금 그건 정말 최고의 한 발이었어요!","source_cn":"破坏？不不不，格温妮丝，你刚才那一箭简直太精彩了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACFE037A62D291BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710236003:1":{"text":"그 먼 거리에서 단 한 발로 과녁을 맞히다니! 게다가 소란 피우던 원숭이까지 단숨에 제압해버렸잖아요!","source_cn":"百步之外，一箭正中靶心！而且还顺便制服了那只捣乱的猴子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A8FCDF89CD5E664","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710236004:1":{"text":"그리고 훔쳐 간 물건도 되찾았고요!","source_cn":"嗯，除此之外，还找回了赃物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4ECB04E50717FB64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710236005:1":{"text":"...운이 좋았던 것뿐이에요.","source_cn":"……只是运气好而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42C18ADCB37517D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_tit